       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SPCSBYCD.
       AUTHOR.         CA YODER.
       INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   SEPTEMBER 1995.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *D   SPCSBYCD                BUYER CODE SUBPROGRAM           *
      *                                                            *
      *D    THIS PROGRAM IS USED TO LOAD BUYER CODES INTO          *
      *D    THE STORES DATA BASE FOR STARTUP ON CSIS.              *
      *D                                                           *
      *D    ** COPIED FROM SBUYRCDE AND MODIFIED **                *
      *D                                                           *
      *D    THIS PROGRAM IS CALLED BY:                             *
      *D                      1.  SPUROPT                          *
      *D                                                           *
      **************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                   ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZSTARTUP-SI
                   ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                   ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                   FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                   CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
            SELECT MBUYER-O
                   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0601
                   ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                   RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC             PIC X(2000).
       FD  MBUYER-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MBUYER-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0600 OF MCFLCS0601.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  SUB1                     PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
       77  SUB2                     PIC S9(4) COMP-4.

       01  BUYER-DOLLAR-WA.
           05  BD-WA OCCURS 8 TIMES PIC X.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1        PIC X VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2        PIC X VALUE SPACE.


      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **              D A T A    B A S E    A R E A              **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       COPY MBUYER IN COPYLIB.
       01  ARG-VALUES.
           05  MBUYER-ARG                PIC X(4).
       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT                  PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD                   PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **                 TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                  **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       01  BUYER-SCREEN.
           05  ADD-BUYER-INFO.
               10  BUYER-CODE1           PIC X(4).
               10  BUYER-NAME1           PIC X(16).
               10  BUYER-PHONE1          PIC X(25).
               10  BUYER-DOLS1           PIC X(8).
           05  MODIFY-BUYER-INFO.
               10  BUYER-CODE2           PIC X(4).
               10  BUYER-NAME2           PIC X(16).
               10  BUYER-PHONE2          PIC X(25).
               10  BUYER-DOLS2           PIC X(8).
      *    05  BUYER-MSGLINE1            PIC X(79).
           05  BUYER-CMDLINE             PIC X(79).
           05  BUYER-ERRLINE             PIC X(79).

       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDATA   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **               LINKAGE   SECTION                         **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  BASE                          PIC X(10).
       COPY VCOMLINK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGSUB  IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE,
                                VIEW-COMAREA,
                                LANGUAGE-PARMS.

       0-SBUYRCODE-SEC SECTION 1.

       0-BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

       1-HSK.
           MOVE "SPCSBYCD" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN I-O MBUYER-O, DISPLAY-FILE.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE MBUYER-O, DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.

      ******************************************************
      **                 BLOWUP ROUTINE                   **
      ******************************************************

       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
                 VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                 BU-DISPLAY-AREA.


      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *                  6 - M A I N                   *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************
       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "BUYRCODE" TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       6-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO BUYER-SCREEN.

      ***  INPUT DATA ABOVE AND PRESS 'ENTER'  ***
      *    MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM.
      *    MOVE  20 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
      *    PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
      *    MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO BUYER-MSGLINE1.

       6-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE BUYER-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC  TO BUYER-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO BUYER-ERRLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM.

       6-EDIT-CHECKS.
           IF BUYER-CODE1 NOT = SPACES AND BUYER-CODE2 NOT = SPACES
               MOVE   3 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  62 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO BUYER-ERRLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND (99), IND(6)
               GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM.

           IF BUYER-CODE1 NOT = SPACES
               MOVE BUYER-CODE1 TO MBUYER-ARG
               MOVE MBUYER-ARG  TO BUYERCDE OF MBUYER-O-REC
               START MBUYER-O KEY = BUYERCDE OF MBUYER-O-REC
                  INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-START
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                  MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO BUYERCDE OF MBUYER-O-REC
                  START MBUYER-O KEY > BUYERCDE OF MBUYER-O-REC
                     INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS
                  END-START
      ****     BUYER CODE ALREADY EXISTS     ****
                  MOVE   2 TO LANG-SETNUM
                  MOVE   3 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                  PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                  MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO BUYER-ERRLINE
                  MOVE B"1" TO IND(99), IND(6)
                  GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM
              ELSE
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                  PERFORM 61-ADD-MBUYER
              ELSE
                  MOVE "READ  MBUYER ERROR IN 6-EDIT-CHECK"
                      TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                  MOVE BUYER-CODE1 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                  PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           IF BUYER-CODE2 NOT = SPACES
               MOVE BUYER-CODE2 TO MBUYER-ARG
               MOVE MBUYER-ARG  TO BUYERCDE OF MBUYER-O-REC
               START MBUYER-O KEY = BUYERCDE OF MBUYER-O-REC
                  INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-START
               IF FILE-STATUS-1  = "2"
      ****     BUYER CODE DOES NOT EXIST     ****
                  MOVE   2 TO LANG-SETNUM
                  MOVE   4 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                  PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                  MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO BUYER-ERRLINE
                  MOVE B"1" TO IND(99), IND(2)
                  GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM
              ELSE
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                  PERFORM 62-MODIFY-MBUYER THRU 62-MODIFY-MBUYER-X
              ELSE
                  MOVE "READ MBUYER ERROR IN 6-EDIT-CHECK"
                      TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                  MOVE BUYER-CODE2 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                  PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           GO TO 6-MAIN.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       61-ADD-MBUYER.
           MOVE SPACES       TO BUF-MBUYER.
           MOVE BUYER-CODE1  TO BUYER-CODE.
           MOVE BUYER-NAME1  TO BUYER-NAME
           MOVE BUYER-PHONE1 TO BUYER-PHONE-NO.
           IF BUYER-DOLS1 NOT = "        "
               MOVE BUYER-DOLS1 TO BUYER-DOLLAR-WA
               PERFORM 69-SHIFT-DOLS-RIGHT THRU 69-S-D-R-X
               MOVE BUYER-DOLLAR-WA TO BUYER-DOLLAR-LIM
           ELSE
           MOVE SPACES       TO BUYER-DOLLAR-LIM.
           WRITE MBUYER-O-REC FROM BUF-MBUYER
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "WRT MBUYER ERROR IN 61-ADD-MBUYER"
                    TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE BUYER-CODE1 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       62-MODIFY-MBUYER.
           READ MBUYER-O NEXT INTO BUF-MBUYER.
           MOVE "BUYRCODEM" TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE BUYER-NAME TO BUYER-NAME2.
           MOVE BUYER-PHONE-NO TO BUYER-PHONE2.
           MOVE BUYER-DOLLAR-LIM TO BUYER-DOLS2.
      ***  INPUT DATA ABOVE AND PRESS 'ENTER'  ***
      *    MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM.
      *    MOVE  20 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
      *    PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
      *    MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO BUYER-MSGLINE1.

       62-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE BUYER-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC  TO BUYER-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 62-MODIFY-MBUYER-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO BUYER-ERRLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

       62-REPLACE-MBUYER.
           MOVE BUYER-NAME2  TO BUYER-NAME.
           MOVE BUYER-PHONE2 TO BUYER-PHONE-NO.
           IF BUYER-DOLS2 NOT = "        "
               MOVE BUYER-DOLS2 TO BUYER-DOLLAR-WA
               PERFORM 69-SHIFT-DOLS-RIGHT THRU 69-S-D-R-X
               MOVE BUYER-DOLLAR-WA TO BUYER-DOLLAR-LIM
           ELSE
           MOVE SPACES       TO BUYER-DOLLAR-LIM.
           REWRITE MBUYER-O-REC FROM BUF-MBUYER
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "REWRITE MBUYER ERROR IN 62-MODIFY-MBUYER"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE BUYER-CODE2 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       62-MODIFY-MBUYER-X.
            EXIT.

       69-SHIFT-DOLS-RIGHT.
           MOVE 8 TO SUB1, SUB2.
           IF BD-WA (SUB1) NOT = " " GO TO 69-S-D-R-ZEROFILL.
       69-S-D-R-FIRST.
           IF BD-WA (SUB1) NOT = " " GO TO 69-S-D-R-ONE.
           IF SUB1 = 1 GO TO 69-S-D-R-ZEROFILL.
           SUBTRACT 1 FROM SUB1.
           GO TO 69-S-D-R-FIRST.
       69-S-D-R-ONE.
           IF BD-WA (SUB1) = " "
               MOVE "0" TO BD-WA (SUB1)
               GO TO 69-S-D-R-ZEROFILL.
           MOVE BD-WA (SUB1) TO BD-WA (SUB2).
           MOVE " " TO BD-WA (SUB1).
           IF SUB1 = 1 GO TO 69-S-D-R-ZEROFILL.
           SUBTRACT 1 FROM SUB1.
           SUBTRACT 1 FROM SUB2.
           GO TO 69-S-D-R-ONE.
       69-S-D-R-ZEROFILL.
           INSPECT BUYER-DOLLAR-WA REPLACING LEADING " " BY "0".
       69-S-D-R-X.    EXIT.

       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
      *********************************************************
       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
